# No line-ending conversion anywhere in this repository.
# The package holds thousands of files whose SHA-256 is recorded in a checksum list, a declaration, a certificate
# or docs/MANIFEST.tsv (written protocols, converted data, certificates, outputs compared byte for byte by
# run_checks.py). A checkout that rewrites line endings on Windows would break every one of those checks, so every
# file is stored and checked out exactly as it is.
* -text

# binary formats (no text diff)
*.npz binary
*.qpy binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
